<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Namíbia · 13–29 dezembro 2026 · Henrique, Cláudia e Sofia</name><description>Roteiro anti-horário de 15 dias, gerado a partir do guia. Uma pasta por dia; os pontos estão na ordem de visita. As linhas são a rota rodoviária calculada (OSRM), não uma estimativa. Cores por piso: AZUL = asfalto, VERDE = asfalto com troços de gravel, LARANJA = gravel todo o dia.</description><Style id="day1"><LineStyle><color>ffff6600</color><width>4</width></LineStyle><IconStyle><color>ffff6600</color><scale>1.0</scale></IconStyle></Style><Folder><name>Dia 01 · chegada e Hardap</name><Placemark><name>D01 09:25 · Hosea Kutako — aterragem</name><description>E-visas impressos; imigração 30-40 min</description><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>17.4720543,-22.4822038,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D01 11:45 · Asco Car Hire — levantar o 4x4</name><description>Briefing 1h; montar as duas tendas antes de sair</description><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>17.0654168,-22.6082441,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D01 13:30 · Grove Mall — compras</name><description>Comida 4-5 dias, 40-50 L de água, gelo</description><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>17.09297,-22.6222954,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D01 16:45 · Trópico de Capricórnio</name><description>Marco na berma da B1, 40 km antes de Mariental</description><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>17.128,-23.5,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D01 17:45 · Hardap Resort</name><description>Campismo na albufeira, 28 parcelas</description><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><Point><coordinates>17.8587624,-24.4965032,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>D01 · 308 km, 3.5 h · asfalto</name><styleUrl>#day1</styleUrl><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>17.469203,-22.48713,0 17.465258,-22.488802,0 17.463974,-22.504336,0 17.46167,-22.50689,0 17.393733,-22.51